# CSS and JS

- Feature styles live in dedicated files (`project-cards.css`, `modal.css`, …) already linked from `_includes/head.html`. One-off overrides go in `custom.css`.
- Work/education columns already stack at `max-width: 600px`. Preserve that when changing layout.
- JS is vanilla (no bundler, no modules). `main.js` owns particles + footer year; `typewriter.js` reads `data-type` / `data-period` on `.typewrite`.
- Do not introduce jQuery, React, or npm packages. CDN scripts already in the footer (particles.js, Font Awesome, Pure.css) are enough.
- Keep `var`/`const` style consistent with the file you are editing.
